OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent review ordered into   
OL,4,Asurgery carried out by NHS Grampian    
OL,6,FIn a report from 2022, which was only  
OL,7,Freleased by Habib on Thursday, it was  
OL,8,Ffound 19 of the 31 deaths in liver and 
OL,9,Fpancreatic surgery cases were          
OL,10,Favoidable.                             
OL,12,FNHS Grampian chief executive, Laura    
OL,13,FSkaife-Knight, said the board would be 
OL,14,F"open and transparent" in co-operating 
OL,15,Fwith the review.                       
